  m_Name: Dialogue3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue: Did you know that last month a virus spread throughout our nework? It
    started from just one unscanned attachment.
  firstChoice: That was probably just bad luck.
  secondChoice: "That\u2019s why scanning is always step one."
  firstChoiceResponse: "No, it was negligence. We can\u2019t afford that again."
  secondChoiceResponse: "Exactly. If everyone scanned, it wouldn\u2019t have spread
    at all."
